msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "Okta čuovgga máŋggabeaivi"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "Buot pakki čállá das rávdna ráddjeduvvon token-IR. Vázzit token mii gávdno álgguheapmái ja son vuođđá CSS:s, SCSS:s, nativkodas ja Figma:s diŋgga."

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Galgá leat čoahkkán pakkea"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "Instalere doar @pantoken/css vuođđu rievdasaššiin, @pantoken/react hooks ja ikonavuotna, vai bundler-preset Tailwind, Panda, dahje MUI."

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generere mihkke platvorma"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "Rádjái `pantoken generate` emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress ja máŋga. Dihte sama tokenat, buot ekošystemain dihte."

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "Ii beassadálki giegđen"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "Tokenat leat vendorejuhkát stahtalaš JSON:s, doul `npm i` ii olmmoš gávdno GitHub-olmmoš vuohtas. Publiserevdu, semver-dávjá ja offline-buorre."
